# English only in `.cursor`

Everything under `.cursor/` — rules, skills, frontmatter, and any future files in this folder — must be written in **English only**.

- Do not add Thai or other non-English prose when creating or editing files under `.cursor/`
- Locale codes such as `th` / `en` in i18n instructions are fine; surrounding explanation must be English
- This rule covers Cursor agent config only — app UI copy may still use `th`/`en` i18n in `design/` and `frontend/`
